{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 5683582176837090296,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "External CI Runners",
      "source_hash": 8743729864909247764,
      "context_hash": 16438944403707053272,
      "translation": "외부 CI 러너",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493849Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The Rust Project mainly runs Continuous Integration (CI) in GitHub Actions.",
      "source_hash": 2088573831664788959,
      "context_hash": 7287942396052851850,
      "translation": "Rust 프로젝트는 주로 GitHub Actions에서 지속적 통합(CI)을 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:58.060115Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "When GitHub Actions do not natively support a target, we use [self-hosted runners](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/concepts/runners/self-hosted-runners).",
      "source_hash": 3921184959605239284,
      "context_hash": 7590666600245887397,
      "translation": "GitHub Actions가 특정 타깃을 기본적으로 지원하지 않는 경우, [자체 호스팅 러너](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/concepts/runners/self-hosted-runners)를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Available software",
      "source_hash": 719964467906658496,
      "context_hash": 1785047141241474638,
      "translation": "사용 가능한 소프트웨어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "GitHub Actions self-hosted runners usually do not contain all the software that is available in GitHub Actions hosted runners (e.g. `ubuntu-latest`).",
      "source_hash": 12434312124337259178,
      "context_hash": 3294913570384509280,
      "translation": "GitHub Actions 자체 호스팅 러너에는 일반적으로 GitHub Actions 호스팅 러너(예: `ubuntu-latest`)에서 사용 가능한 모든 소프트웨어가 포함되어 있지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "If you see a CI failure on a self-hosted runner, check if the software you need is available.",
      "source_hash": 9603761741936210889,
      "context_hash": 3349210877847095820,
      "translation": "자체 호스팅 러너에서 CI 실패가 발생하면, 필요한 소프트웨어가 사용 가능한지 확인하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "If it is not, you can install it in your GitHub Actions workflow.",
      "source_hash": 1627635245253233398,
      "context_hash": 1690925687448997144,
      "translation": "사용 가능하지 않다면, GitHub Actions 워크플로에서 이를 설치할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Policy",
      "source_hash": 15600915023236860189,
      "context_hash": 9704960055720851400,
      "translation": "정책",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "If you want to add a new external CI runner, please read our [policy](https://github.com/rust-lang/infra-team/blob/main/service-catalog/rust-ci/external-runners/README.md) first.",
      "source_hash": 14072463269010826116,
      "context_hash": 1406490744875000235,
      "translation": "새로운 외부 CI 러너를 추가하려면, 먼저 저희 [정책](https://github.com/rust-lang/infra-team/blob/main/service-catalog/rust-ci/external-runners/README.md)을 읽어 주십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configured external CI runners",
      "source_hash": 2330119707987668925,
      "context_hash": 5394274841338410970,
      "translation": "구성된 외부 CI 러너",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This section lists the external CI runners that are configured to run in the CI of the Rust Project.",
      "source_hash": 7178084021591980455,
      "context_hash": 9835846778913413402,
      "translation": "이 절에서는 Rust 프로젝트의 CI에서 실행되도록 구성된 외부 CI 러너를 나열합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:58.060116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Here is an explanation of the fields in the list below:",
      "source_hash": 1041769640812839385,
      "context_hash": 16103191132266476762,
      "translation": "아래 목록의 필드에 대한 설명은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`max concurrency`: The available number of runners of this type.",
      "source_hash": 12198879532970029254,
      "context_hash": 14458209569427093433,
      "translation": "`max concurrency`: 이 유형의 사용 가능한 러너 수입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "This determines the maximum number of GitHub Actions jobs that can run on the runner.",
      "source_hash": 15222469161432178192,
      "context_hash": 5848868688279114048,
      "translation": "이는 해당 러너에서 실행할 수 있는 최대 GitHub Actions 작업 수를 결정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "The concurrency is shared among repositories.",
      "source_hash": 16016174366927276165,
      "context_hash": 7028034447643576295,
      "translation": "동시성은 저장소 간에 공유됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:3",
      "source": "If all runners are busy, GitHub Actions will queue the jobs until a runner is available.",
      "source_hash": 1998342563095283230,
      "context_hash": 846906877858900553,
      "translation": "모든 러너가 사용 중이면, GitHub Actions는 러너를 사용할 수 있을 때까지 작업을 대기열에 넣습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`runs-on`: The label(s) that you should use in the `runs-on` field of a GitHub Actions workflow to run this runner.",
      "source_hash": 16212149336430872240,
      "context_hash": 3888357902036850053,
      "translation": "`runs-on`: 이 러너를 실행하기 위해 GitHub Actions 워크플로의 `runs-on` 필드에 사용해야 하는 레이블입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "label": "레이블"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:58.060116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "To check where a runner is used, search for the label in [GitHub Search](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Arust-lang%20%5B%22self-hosted%22%2C%20%22linux%22%2C%20%22powerpc64%22%2C%20%22musl%22%5D&type=code).",
      "source_hash": 17355485204630733580,
      "context_hash": 10738685524417814141,
      "translation": "러너가 어디에서 사용되는지 확인하려면 [GitHub 검색](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Arust-lang%20%5B%22self-hosted%22%2C%20%22linux%22%2C%20%22powerpc64%22%2C%20%22musl%22%5D&type=code)에서 해당 레이블을 검색하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "label": "레이블"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:58.060117Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`repositories`: The repositories that are enabled to use the runner.",
      "source_hash": 11108370440636019539,
      "context_hash": 11517626197954752772,
      "translation": "`repositories`: 이 러너를 사용하도록 활성화된 저장소입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "To add your repository to the list, please open a PR to this file.",
      "source_hash": 7132004201702243350,
      "context_hash": 327074926613928331,
      "translation": "저장소를 목록에 추가하려면, 이 파일에 PR을 열어 주십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "Make sure the workflow you want to run the runner on passes [`zizmor`](https://zizmor.sh/).",
      "source_hash": 7141927028809711006,
      "context_hash": 5456714852329803606,
      "translation": "러너에서 실행하려는 워크플로가 [`zizmor`](https://zizmor.sh/)를 통과하는지 확인하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`contact`: The contact information of the person(s) responsible for maintaining the runner.",
      "source_hash": 15076897220826628905,
      "context_hash": 1733710165062866196,
      "translation": "`contact`: 러너 유지 관리를 담당하는 사람(들)의 연락처 정보입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:41:26.493851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "The recommended way to contact them is via Zulip, by opening a new topic in the [#t-infra](https://rust-lang.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/242791-t-infra) channel and mentioning the contact person(s).",
      "source_hash": 15909529678127595716,
      "context_hash": 12935451607005811809,
      "translation": "담당자에게 연락하는 권장 방법은 Zulip을 통하는 것으로, [#t-infra](https://rust-lang.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/242791-t-infra) 채널에 새 토픽을 열어 담당자를 멘션하면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:58.060118Z",
      "issues": []
    },
